OL,4,BPioneer or coach-eater? The complex    
OL,5,Bworld of Pozzo's Watford               
OL,6,GA week is said to be a long time in    
OL,7,Gfootball, and few clubs offer a more   
OL,8,Gcompelling test of that theory than    
OL,9,GWatford.                               
OL,11,FIt has been 14 years since the Pozzo   
OL,12,Ffamily completed their takeover of the 
OL,13,FHornets and Alessio Dionisi's          
OL,14,Fdismissal leaves them searching for    
OL,15,Fthe 25th permanent boss of their       
OL,16,Ftenure.                                
